  "diagnosis": "The upgrade to version 2025-03-31.basil removed the top\u2011level `payment_intent` field from the Invoice object, causing a KeyError when the old code accessed `invoice[\"payment_intent\"]`. The new API exposes payment information via the `invoice.payments` array, where each entry contains a nested `payment` object. The adapter must iterate over `invoice[\"payments\"][\"data\"]`, filter for entries where `payment[\"type\"]` is \"payment_intent\", and collect non\u2011null `payment_intent` IDs.",
